<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This Macro Allows you to Perfect Green anywhere in the 2 point Range, maybe just slighty out of the paint to on the 3 line but during testing i was having issues with long shots. 

Make Sure you Player is a sharpshooter or this script may not work how it supposed to. 
recommend using it on a mouse button like all my other shooting scripts but if you dont like that or dont have a mouse with side buttons use what ever you prefer</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 527 ms
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 69 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 225 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 625 ms
KeyUp 8 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>ROBLOX</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>